.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees.conf
.Nd FileES server toolchain configuration
.Pq Pa /etc/filees/server.json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The FileES server tools read a single JSON document, by default
.Pa /etc/filees/server.json .
The schema name is
.Cm filees.server-toolchain/v1 .
The file must be a regular file, not group- or other-writable, and every
path value must be absolute.
.Pp
Loaders that need secrets take an explicit secret set.
A tool that does not need SMTP does not open the SMTP password file.
.Sh FIELDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic schema
Must be
.Cm filees.server-toolchain/v1 .
.It Ic root
Private onboarding directory.
Default layout is
.Pa /var/filees/onboarding .
.It Ic otp_pepper_file
At least 32 bytes of base64 pepper.
Regenerating it invalidates outstanding OTPs.
.It Ic worker_private_key_file , worker_public_key_file
Ed25519 key used by
.Xr filees-worker 8
when it pins the client helper.
.It Ic activation
Absolute runtime paths: activation root, session root, authorized_keys,
service authz, service working copy, service repository, client and mobile
entry paths, and the
.Nm svn
and
.Nm svnserve
binaries.
.It Ic repositories.root
Absolute FSFS storage root.
.Pa /var/filees/repositories
is a default, not a required mount point.
.It Ic repositories.results_root
Durable worker results, separate from FSFS data.
.It Ic repositories.url_prefix
Canonical public prefix.
It must be
.Cm svn+ssh://_filees-data@host/
with no explicit port.
The SSH port belongs in the client transport profile and in
.Ic invitation.server_address .
.It Ic repositories.deletion_retention_days
Days to keep a verified dump after a permanent detach.
Omitted defaults to 30.
Explicit
.Cm 0
deletes FSFS immediately and writes no dump.
.It Ic repositories.recovery_admin_contact
Mailbox used for data-erasure notices.
.It Ic public_shares
Optional distribution channel.
Disabled by default.
See
.Xr filees-public-authority 8
and
.Xr filees-public-links 5 .
.It Ic invitation
Stable
.Ic server_id ,
public SSH
.Ic server_address
and the verified Ed25519
.Ic known_host
line carried in every invitation.
.It Ic smtp
Submission-style relay.
.Ic tls
is
.Cm starttls ,
.Cm implicit
or
.Cm none
.Pq loopback only .
.Ic password_file
is required when
.Ic username
is set.
.It Ic operation_ttl , otp_attempts
Onboarding operation lifetime and wrong-OTP limit.
.It Ic reverse_port_first , reverse_port_last
Permitted reverse-tunnel ports.
A single static port is the supported deployment.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/filees/server.json
Installed configuration.
.It Pa /etc/filees/server.example.json
Example shipped in the server bundle.
.It Pa /etc/filees/otp.pepper
OTP pepper, mode 0600.
.It Pa /etc/filees/smtp.password
Optional SMTP secret, mode 0600, owner
.Sy _filees-state .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Validate the non-secret path after editing:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ doas -u _filees-state filees-admin ticket list
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees 7 ,
.Xr filees-admin 8 ,
.Xr filees-public-links 5
